{"title": "Psionic Dominance", "pageid": 18879, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Dominance", "categories": ["Class actions", "Reactions", "Bugs", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Psionic_Dominance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp/300px-Psionic_Dominance.webp, /w/images/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp/300px-Psionic_Dominance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Psionic Dominance</b> is a reaction and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. This feature allows a character to use a reaction to nullify a spell of lower or equal level to their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> when cast by an enemy within 18 m (60 ft).\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nWhen an enemy within 18 m (60 ft) targets you with a spell of a Level that is lower than or equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a>, you can use your reaction to nullify the spell.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_TAD_PsionicDominance</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_PsionicDominance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_PsionicDominance\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Action component</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_TAD_PsionicDominance</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_TAD_PsionicDominance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_TAD_PsionicDominance\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Reaction component</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>After becoming a <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>, unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/38px-Charm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/50px-Charm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\">Charm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Hole\" title=\"Black Hole\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Hole\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Hole\" title=\"Black Hole\">Black Hole</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Normally, this reaction can counter a spell of up to level 4 since that is the usual maximum proficiency bonus. However, on <a href=\"/wiki/Explorer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explorer\">Explorer</a> difficulty, the proficiency bonus of <em>all</em> characters is increased by 2. This means Psionic Dominance can counter up to level 6 spells on Explorer difficulty, including when enemies use it against the party. Custom difficulty offers a slider to adjust the proficiency bonus which has the same effect.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction cannot be used while affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/40px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Starry Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\">Starry Form</a> or when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguised</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2676/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32676/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13416/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1386431/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.923      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   59.923      1 -total\n 83.98%   50.325     33 Template:Trim\n 21.07%   12.624      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 19.97%   11.964      6 Template:Icon_text\n 14.08%    8.435      1 Template:Resource\n 10.98%    6.578      4 Template:Icon_link\n 10.78%    6.461      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.75%    5.842      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.59%    4.550      2 Template:SmSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash